                <invention-title lang="de">MULTIKOPTER MIT ABGEWINKELTEN ROTOREN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MULTICOPTÈRE À ROTORS INCLINÉS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MULTICOPTER WITH ANGLED ROTORS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A multicopter with angled rotors is disclosed. In various embodiments, a multicopter as disclosed herein includes a fuselage and a plurality of rotors. At least some of the rotors are disposed on opposite sides of the fuselage and each is oriented at a corresponding angle to a substantially horizontal plane of the aircraft, the angle being of a magnitude such that a plane of rotation of the rotor does not intersect at least a critical portion of the fuselage.</p>
